WEBVTT

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.442
ju harroni per te

00:05:00.442 --> 00:05:03.145
eshte lehte te harrosh

00:05:03.145 --> 00:05:06.227
qe ka ndodhur ne 2007-ten kur je e keni perkur

00:05:06.227 --> 00:05:08.997
per here te pare sepse eshte bere

00:05:08.997 --> 00:05:10.634
as shpejte pervasive

00:05:10.634 --> 00:05:13.060
dhe sepse sa shpesh

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:15.430
jemi adaptuar ne keto gjeste

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:18.425
dhe te beshe nje ndarje ne jeten tone

00:05:18.425 --> 00:05:20.931
jo si ndertesa Thene

00:05:20.931 --> 00:05:22.954
kjo nuk eshte nje teknologji aliene

00:05:22.954 --> 00:05:24.716
ose duhet te them

00:05:24.716 --> 00:05:26.515
qfare ka bere eshte ka marre teknologjine

00:05:26.515 --> 00:05:27.947
qe,jo si njerizit ne kete dhome

00:05:27.947 --> 00:05:29.041
shume nga njerezit ne bote

00:05:29.041 --> 00:05:30.272
ende ndihen shume aliene